WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,600
She is obviously a girl

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,800
How can he be a boy?

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,240
Her original god is a boy

4
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,240
The fairy boy who was supposed to be a god sat down

5
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,240
He sneaked out and fell in with the goddess by mistake

6
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,840
She serves the righteous god

7
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,000
She won't go back to work

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,280
Should we let Zhengshen do the work?

9
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,840
There are also rules above

10
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:15,120
She's breaking the rules

11
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,240
That can't be resolved

12
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,520
She will really die

13
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,080
What should her parents do?

14
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,930
Can't resolve

15
00:00:20,930 --> 00:00:23,030
She will die after her eighteenth birthday

16
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,710
If things weren't so urgent

17
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:26,710
Let's go up there as a substitute for her.

18
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:28,070
What kind of work can I do for Zhengshen?

19
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,630
Wait until the child's life span is up

20
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:32,640
Naturally, go up and be punished

21
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,240
Then quickly give her a substitute

22
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:36,240
The more you delay, the less you can walk.

23
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:41,980
So what are you waiting for?

24
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,260
Is it Master Liu?

25
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,500
Come inside and get warm

26
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,420
It seems that her wife just made a move with her

27
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:50,210
Brought in two more swindlers

28
00:00:50,210 --> 00:00:51,210
Brother Qiao

29
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:52,330
Your wife doesn’t believe this

30
00:00:52,330 --> 00:00:54,490
There's no need for us to ask for trouble. Let's go first.
